---
title: "contest_points_allocation (Sherlock Watsons)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_participants: identify all ranked participants in contest
    q_get_participants --> q_sum_leaderboard: sum leaderboard_points of all participants
    q_sum_leaderboard --> q_add_inflation: total_contest_points = sum + inflation_amount
    q_add_inflation --> q_calc_shares: for each watson, compute issue_point_share
    q_calc_shares --> q_distribute: watson_contest_points = share * total_contest_points
    q_distribute --> q_weight_by_days: weight contest_points by contest_days
    q_weight_by_days --> [*]: return contest_points per watson

    note right of q_sum_leaderboard
        INV-001: Total contest points = sum of all competitors leaderboard points + inflation
        INV-002: Inflation ensures new entrants can earn points
    end note

    note right of q_weight_by_days
        INV-003: Longer contests (more contest-days) have higher weight
        INV-004: 3-day contest counts for ~4% of leaderboard (3/70 days)
        INV-005: 4-week contest counts for ~40% of leaderboard (28/70 days)
    end note
